    "他从不残酷地对待你，这个巨人只是将你留在身边，让你永远待在符文的蓝光中，永远保持着准备就绪且充盈的状态。"

translate schinese_rewrite BadEnd_Jotunn_Suck_a8e13066:

    # "Years blend together in the endless twilight of the ice chamber. Blizzards rage and fade outside, but inside nothing changes."
    "冰室无尽的暮色中，岁月彼此交融。外面的暴风雪肆虐又消退，而里面始终没有任何变化。"

translate schinese_rewrite BadEnd_Jotunn_Suck_cdcf1cd9:

    # "Eventually you forget what it was like to be free, to be an adventurer, to have a life outside this cave. The Jotunn is your world now, it's the only thing you know."
    "最终，你忘记了自由是什么感觉，忘记了冒险者的生活，也忘记了这座洞窟之外的人生。如今，约顿就是你的整个世界，你所知晓的仅此而已。"

translate schinese_rewrite BadEnd_Jotunn_Suck_cf435364:

    # "Every time he fills your throat, every time he rests his hand on your head, every time he simply sits and watches you, the runes under your skin glow brighter with each passing season, until they shine in perfect rhythm with his own."
    "每当他填满你的喉咙，每当他将手放在你的头上，每当他只是坐在那里注视着你，皮肤下的符文便随着季节流逝而愈发明亮，直到与他自身的符文完美同步。"
